        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "The eight hallmarks of mathematical exposition, scored 0-2 with sixteen the only passing total, derived from John Milnor's \"Link Groups\" (1954). The author-facing half of the `expo-milnor-clarity` strict gate; three of its findings contradict the general house voice and say so."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "milnor-exposition-standard",
